{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01909",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 5.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Oh, good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.27,
      "end_seconds": 10.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.33,
      "end_seconds": 17.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Well, you know, I've been having an itchy scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.23,
      "end_seconds": 24.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.72,
      "end_seconds": 29.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.38,
      "end_seconds": 33.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.42,
      "end_seconds": 50.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.73,
      "text": "Hmm, it usually comes with seeing tiny bugs in the hair. Erm, the seeing tiny bugs in the hair? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.73,
      "end_seconds": 54.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, and what about fever or swollen glands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.87,
      "end_seconds": 61.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "No, uh, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.71,
      "end_seconds": 63.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any rash on the body?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.15,
      "end_seconds": 70.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Ah, you know, I haven't noticed any rash on the body."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.46,
      "end_seconds": 76.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Right, right. Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.36,
      "end_seconds": 81.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "No, um, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.55,
      "end_seconds": 86.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.14,
      "end_seconds": 93.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Hmm, my heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.86,
      "end_seconds": 96.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.82,
      "end_seconds": 97.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.02,
      "end_seconds": 114.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "So, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.18,
      "end_seconds": 120.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "So, yes, wheat. I get bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.02,
      "end_seconds": 125.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.87,
      "end_seconds": 135.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, I'm on metformin, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.07,
      "end_seconds": 139.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.84,
      "end_seconds": 141.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.21,
      "end_seconds": 143.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.86,
      "end_seconds": 164.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.49,
      "end_seconds": 168.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.78,
      "end_seconds": 172.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.63,
      "end_seconds": 178.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.12,
      "end_seconds": 181.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.32,
      "end_seconds": 185.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.12,
      "end_seconds": 190.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.06,
      "end_seconds": 205.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.12,
      "end_seconds": 228.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.0 degrees, heart rate 66, BP is 115 over 74, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.99,
      "end_seconds": 233.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.9,
      "end_seconds": 236.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.28,
      "end_seconds": 239.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.5,
      "end_seconds": 262.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "I can see live lice and small eggs close to the roots behind the ears."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.53,
      "end_seconds": 268.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.52,
      "end_seconds": 301.56,
      "duration_seconds": 23.04,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with head lice at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let's use dimeticone lotion, 4%, once, repeat after seven days, two applications. That's for head lice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.31,
      "end_seconds": 306.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "So, how soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.91,
      "end_seconds": 325.4,
      "duration_seconds": 17.49,
      "text": "Comb the hair with a fine comb every few days and check the family. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Let's review you if lice persist after two treatments."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 326.73,
      "end_seconds": 330.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.66,
      "end_seconds": 336.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.45,
      "end_seconds": 342.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "I mean, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.79,
      "end_seconds": 345.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}